DTSTART;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260815T090000
DTEND;TZID=Africa/Johannesburg:20260816T170000
SUMMARY:ADTC build sprint 1 — model selection + quantisation
DESCRIPTION:Target: a candidate model running under 7GB peak RAM at >15 to
 k/s on the ADTC Standard Laptop profile (i5 10-12th gen / Ryzen 5 3000-50
 00\, 8GB DDR4\, integrated graphics\, Ubuntu 22.04).\nRemember the score:
  50% accuracy\, 30% throughput\, 20% efficiency\, -10 if you throttle abo
 ve 85C. OOM = disqualification.
CATEGORIES:PREP
TRANSP:OPAQUE
