SUMMARY:ADTC feature freeze + full benchmark run
DESCRIPTION:No new features after tonight. Run the official profiler end-t
 o-end. Record latency\, throughput\, peak RAM\, CPU and thermals. If it O
 OMs on 8GB you have three days to fix it — that's the point of freezing
  now.
